# PART 6: ASSESSMENTS AND PRACTICAL PROJECTS

Every module must have a short knowledge check.

Each module assessment should contain approximately five questions.

Questions should test the content actually taught in that module.

Use a combination of:
- Multiple-choice questions.
- Practical scenario questions.
