The final assessment must evaluate the complete course.

### Capstone project submission

Each course must have a practical final project.

Provide a submission interface where participants can:

- Read project instructions.
- View assessment criteria.
- Submit a project description.
- Submit a project link or file, if file submission is supported.
- View submission status.
- Receive feedback where an authorised reviewer is available.

Do not claim projects have been reviewed automatically unless a functioning review system exists.

### Completion criteria

A course is complete when the participant:

1. Completes all required lessons.
2. Completes all module assessments.
3. Passes the final assessment using a configurable pass mark.
4. Completes the capstone project requirement if the course requires it.

Allow administrators to configure the pass mark and completion requirements.

